        "request_id": "1c4b7b107d4f4cb4",
        "answer": "I found the NewsKiosk payment on your account:\n\n- **Transaction:** TX-0901\n- **Date:** 2026-09-07\n- **Amount:** EUR 19.99 (card payment, settled)\n\nI can't ask NewsKiosk for a refund directly. What I can do is open a dispute on this transaction, but only if it fits one of these reasons:\n\n- **Duplicate charge:** you were charged more than once for the same purchase.\n- **Goods not received:** you paid but didn't receive the item.\n- **Service not rendered:** the service you paid for wasn't provided.\n- **Unauthorized debit:** you didn't authorize this payment.\n- **Card-not-present fraud:** someone used your card details without your permission.\n\nWhich of these describes your situation? Tell me the reason and I'll check whether the dispute is eligible before opening anything. If none of them apply, the other route is to contact NewsKiosk directly and ask for a refund.",
        "step_number": 1,
